    "body": "@TRowbotham that is an interesting example. I support changing the `Location` object as well for consistency. We can't really test it, but I think that's fine. If we ever decide to limit what URLs can be loaded in a browsing context we can have another look at the `Location` object API and adjust it accordingly.",
